    "body": "Depends on #1620\n\nAdds an opt-in `backup` observation to the existing published Pages workflow. A fresh profile enters through the ordinary password form, starts and pauses Solo, exports progress through Missions, discards the owned download, and returns Home with the same paused public state.\n\nThe default and Missions flows, two-opening Missions requirement, source/public identity checks, and 570/600/720-second limits are unchanged. The 1 MiB limit applies to retained/read/parsed bytes; this verifies a fresh basic backup envelope and ordinary filename, not download acquisition, historical backups, restore, or durable-save completeness.\n\nValidation: independent source and lifecycle review completed; the prospective source/browser sparse closure covers all 133 reachable static-import files. Seventeen new source controls await hosted CI. No local tests, builds, or native observations were run.\n\nThis draft preserves the reviewed #1620 dependency and includes a normal merge of current main. Keep it unmerged through #1620\u2019s publication and its retained Missions observation. This PR does not dispatch a native browser run."
  },
